      "content": "it just feels so performative. trying to \"find the spark\" or \"uncover hidden parts\" feels like I'm just trying to fix a machine that's already broken beyond repair. if the creative part of me is what made me me, and that's gone, then what am I actually trying to save? it feels like I'm just dragging around a shell that doesn't belong to me anymore.",
